6,"digest":"sha256:98c67675d67a80b9658ff074c116dcd3f8b004a1e80d267ed8e6cd5b0f881c16","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T12:29:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:29:34Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/download/v3.1.7/SHA256SUMS.txt"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/assets/659273788","id":659273788,"node_id":"RA_kwDOU7jAW84nS7g8","name":"trust_publisher.bat","label":"","uploader":{"login":"muthumanikandanb2005-ux","id":226152175,"node_id":"U_kgDODXrO7w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/226152175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","html_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":1527,"digest":"sha256:3ab7a8977f3d7745f7a56a3e200c6312d1cf40852d8ab6d9751c46ff333589d4","download_count":0,"created_at":"2026-10-20T12:29:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T12:29:32Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/download/v3.1.7/trust_publisher.bat"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/tarball/v3.1.7","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/zipball/v3.1.7","body":"## Pulse Music v3.1.7 (OTA Update for Android & Windows)\n\n### ≡ƒÄ╡ Verified Publisher & Code Signing (Windows)\n- Fully signed binary (`Pulse.exe`) and setup installer (`PulseMusic-v3.1.7-windows-x64-Setup.exe`) with **Pulse Music Studio** Authenticode certificate and RFC 3161 DigiCert timestamping.\n- Bundled `PulseMusic.cer` and automated trust tool (`trust_publisher.bat`) for seamless publisher verification.\n\n### ≡ƒô¥ Synchronized Lyrics Engine\n- Locked exclusively to **LRCLIB** provider via high-priority client ID `Q577SzaQFl01aTiReKY9NKgkcENPwiaHVceaOk4p8JQ`.\n- Immediate lyrics state reset on song transition: songs will never display previous track lyrics or identical lyrics.\n- Automatic fallback from exact duration match to duration-agnostic query to handle video/album master track length drift.\n\n### ≡ƒöï Continuous Background Playback & Android Stability\n- Kept media service binding intact across phone lock/unlock and app switching, preventing OEM battery optimizers from killing background playback.\n- Replaced legacy dual-notification system with unified Android Media3 foreground provider.\n- Quadrupled hardware AudioTrack buffer capacity (~250-300ms) to eliminate underruns and audio breakage during CPU frequency scaling.\n- Configured low-latency Wi-Fi lock and unconstrained wake lock during active playback.\n\n### ΓÜí Stale Pause Recovery & Buffering Watchdog\n- Automatic invalidation of expired CDN streaming sockets when resuming after $\\ge 45\\text{s}$ pause.\n- Built-in 4-second buffering watchdog automatically recovers stalled streams without user intervention.\n\n### ≡ƒÜÇ Performance & UI Smoothness\n- Eliminated all main-thread blocking calls (`runBlocking`) from audio/video playback handlers and viewmodels.\n- Fixed `IllegalArgumentException: Key was already used` in SearchScreen by deduplicating search results and applying composite indexed keys.\n- Thread-safe Windows DataStore atomic file operations.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/muthumanikandanb2005-ux/PulseMusic/releases/418373528/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
